# ============================================================
# Murmur — environment layout
# There is NO workspace-level .env. Each app owns its own:
#
#   apps/web/.env.local     ← copy from apps/web/.env.local.example
#   apps/mobile/.env        ← copy from apps/mobile/.env.example
#                             (read by `expo start` only; EAS builds
#                             take env from apps/mobile/eas.json)
#
# Environment separation:
#   - Production values live ONLY in the `production` EAS profile
#     (apps/mobile/eas.json) and in Vercel's Production environment.
#   - `development` / `preview` EAS profiles resolve their env from
#     EAS Environment Variables (expo.dev dashboard) — fill those with
#     the staging project's values, never production's.
# ============================================================
